{
  "tema": 6469,
  "slug": "condicional-deber",
  "titulo": "Conjugate deber in the conditional",
  "subtitulo": "Debería, deberías: regular, and perfect for advice.",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Deber is regular in the conditional: debería, deberías, debería, deberíamos, deberían, always followed by an infinitive.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Deber** (_must, should_; also _to owe_) is **regular** in the conditional: the whole infinitive plus the regular endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**deber**",
            "**-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "deber"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "debería"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "deberías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "debería"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "deberíamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "deberían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "When it means _must_ or _should_, **deber** is followed by an **infinitive**. (With a noun it means _to owe_: **te debo cien pesos**.) In the conditional, **deber** + infinitive gives advice: what you _should_ do."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: no surprises in the stem, so all the attention goes to the advice."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Yo ==debería tomar== menos café.",
              "en": "I should drink less coffee."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tú ==deberías sacar== tu licencia de manejo.",
              "en": "You should get your driver's license."
            },
            {
              "es": "Usted ==debería relajarse== antes de dormir.",
              "en": "You should relax before going to sleep."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nosotros ==deberíamos celebrar== el cumpleaños de Beto.",
              "en": "We should celebrate Beto's birthday."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ellas ==deberían pintar== el cuarto.",
              "en": "They should paint the room."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==deberían visitar== el Centro Cultural Tijuana.",
              "en": "You should visit the Tijuana Cultural Center."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
